# SHA-256 hashes of banned private names, one lowercase hex digest per line.
# The names themselves stay out of this public repository.
# Add a name with: printf '%s' 'the name' | shasum -a 256
# Optional local names can be supplied as newline-separated plaintext in
# CYBERAU_PRIVATE_NAMES. The workflow does not set that variable and does
# not carry a secret.
